# About

I'm **Zander Lewis** — a 17-year-old software engineer living in **Candler, NC** (he/him). I am learning [+D] and [+Scala], and I use [+linux]. I am currently involved with **Limelight Robotics**.

I like building things that are fast, understandable, and actually shippable.

